	 *    turn off the radio
	 *    clear transmit machinery
	 *    clear receive machinery
	 *    drain and release tx queues
	 *    reclaim beacon resources
	 *    power down hardware
	 *
	 * Note that some of this work is not possible if the
	 * hardware is gone (invalid).
